  "description": "NINLIH crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 41/a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C108 H172 Ho8 N16 O40,4(C1 H4 O1),4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho5 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho6 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho7 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho8 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.695-3.826 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.00-114.01°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ho8(LH2)4(μ-Piv)4(η2-Piv)4(μ-OMe)4]·4CH3OH·4H2O.",
